OBS Modules for OMNeT++ and OMNEST
------------------------------------

OBSmodules is a set of modules to simulate Optical Burst Switching networks in the OMNeT++ framework

This repository holds **code only** (`src/`, `Examples/`, `test/`, `utils/`).
Research reports, plans, architecture diagrams, literature and raw simulation
data live in the sibling private repository `../OBSmodules-docs`; the research
state of record is `../OBSmodules-docs/research_status.md`.
